{"timestamp":"2026-09-18T14:53:49.488Z","ordinal":4061,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a0b3f5-d570-7a72-b668-401efd539e3b","turn_id":"01a0b4f9-6008-7481-8c13-f3c8d9cbf433","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_05349b17f5ad9d6a016aad507c6cfc87d0892c77c4d56a2386","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The first focused run exposed two test-expectation issues, not implementation regressions: the payload uses the configured redaction marker, and a target-kind value collision is intentionally recoverable via the safe fallback. I’m separating that case from the unrecoverable fixed-key collision the review identified."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1789743228484,"completed_at_ms":1789743229488}}
