retain earlier current-code evidence. Outdated status was not used as proof.\n383:- Invalid / Accepted Risk: 1 older GitHub finding remains invalid based on observed key-redaction behavior; no accepted risks.\n384:- Not Attempted: the preserved Sonar maintainability/reliability inventory remains 36 findings under `MCP170-SONAR-MAINTAINABILITY`. The captured Sonar analysis check is successful, but individual analyzer details were not substituted for the GitHub review snapshot or declared fixed.\n387:## Round 8 required-check snapshot\n391:## Round 8 convergence\n398:- Oldest deferred blocker: `MCP170-SONAR-MAINTAINABILITY` from round 1, last observed at 36 findings. It remains Not Attempted and prevents a clean assessment.\n402:## Round 8 verification evidence\n410:## Round 8 termination\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a0b4f9-6008-7481-8c13-f3c8d9cbf433","create_time":1789743371.358729}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
