ag on both endpoints.\\\\\\\"\\\\n+      },\\\\n+      {\\\\n+        \\\\\\\"family\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"memoryfn-runtime-scope-validation\\\\\\\",\\\\n+        \\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"fixed\\\\\\\",\\\\n+        \\\\\\\"recurring\\\\\\\": true,\\\\n+        \\\\\\\"invariant\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Malformed non-string tenant identifiers produce the canonical scope error instead of a trim TypeError.\\\\\\\"\\\\n+      },\\\\n+      {\\\\n+        \\\\\\\"family\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"memoryfn-server-managed-insert-fields\\\\\\\",\\\\n+        \\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"fixed\\\\\\\",\\\\n+        \\\\\\\"recurring\\\\\\\": true,\\\\n+        \\\\\\\"invariant\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"MemoryInsert excludes revision and deletedAt because bundled adapters own those lifecycle fields.\\\\\\\"\\\\n+      },\\\\n+      {\\\\n+        \\\\\\\"family\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"langfn-evaluation-identity\\\\\\\",\\\\n+        \\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"fixed\\\\\\\",\\\\n+        \\\\\\\"recurring\\\\\\\": false,\\\\n+        \\\\\\\"invariant\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Duplicate metric and model names fail before provider work, and comparison results use a null-prototype map.\\\\\\\"\\\\n+      },\\\\n+      {\\\\n+        \\\\\\\"family\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"langfn-testfn-run-identity\\\\\\\",\\\\n+        \\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"fixed\\\\\\\",\\\\n+        \\\\\\\"recurring\\\\\\\": false,\\\\n+        \\\\\\\"invariant\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Every TestFn export receives a unique run identifier even for repeated evaluations of the same model.\\\\\\\"\\\\n+      },\\\\n+      {\\\\n+        \\\\\\\"family\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"langfn-evaluation-accuracy\\\\\\\",\\\\n+        \\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"fixed\\\\\\\",\\\\n+        \\\\\\\"recurring\\\\\\\": false,\\\\n+        \\\\\\\"invariant\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Accuracy and passRate measure passed items while avgScore independently measures graded score.\\\\\\\"\\\\n+      },\\\\n+      {\\\\n+        \\\\\\\"family\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"openai-stream-completion-sentinel\\\\\\\",\\\\n+        \\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"fixed\\\\\\\",\\\\n+        \\\\\\\"recurring\\\\\\\": false,\\\\n+        \\\\\\\"invariant\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"An OpenAI stream that reaches EOF without the DONE sentinel fails as truncated instead of reporting success.\\\\\\\"\\\\n+      },\\\\n+      {\\\\n+        \\\\\\\"family\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"secfn-admin-body-bounds\\\\\\\",\\\\n+        \\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"fixed\\\\\\\",\\\\n+        \\\\\\\"recurring\\\\\\\": true,\\\\n+        \\\\\\\"invariant\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Admin request bodies are bounded before authorization, parsed through the shared cached context, configurable, and limited to 1 MiB by default.\\\\\\\"\\\\n+      },\\\\n+      {\\\\n+        \\\\\\\"family\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"langfn-mcp-transient-server-lifecycle\\\\\\\",\\\\n+        \\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"fixed\\\\\\\",\\\\n+        \\\\\\\"recurring\\\\\\\": false,\\\\n+        \\\\\\\"invariant\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Transient MCP servers are removed from activeServers when their connected transport closes.\\\\\\\"\\\\n+      },\\\\n+      {\\\\n+        \\\\\\\"family\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"google-abort-error-precedence\\\\\\\",\\\\n+        \\\\\\\"status\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"fixed\\\\\\\",\\\\n+        \\\\\\\"recurring\\\\\\\": false,\\\\n+        \\\\\\\"invariant\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Timeout reasons replace only actual abort rejections; already-classified provider HTTP errors survive delayed response cleanup.\\\\\\\"\\\\n+      }\\\\n+    ],\\\\n+    \\\\\\\"relatedDefectsDiscovered\\\\\\\": [\\\\n+      \\\\\\\"The shared bounded body reader awaited cancellation on a tee'd request stream, so an unused authorization clone could stall a 413 response; cancellation now starts without waiting for other tee branches.\\\\\\\",\\\\n+      \\\\\\\"The MemoryFn relationship scope gap existed in both the in-memory and PostgreSQL adapters and in the pipeline caller, so the repair was applied at the shared interface and every bundled imp