etails</summary>\\n\\n````markdown\\n# Keep cleanup retryable when report structure is unsafe\\n\\n## Affected sites\\n- `mcpfn/testing/src/suite.ts:285-307` — captures failed close/revocation ownership in `retainedCleanup`.\\n- `mcpfn/testing/src/suite.ts:389-394` — throws the structural-collision error before ownership is transferred.\\n- `mcpfn/testing/src/suite.ts:407` — the normal `McpFnTargetSuiteCleanupError` handoff is unreachable on this branch.\\n\\n## Required outcome\\n- A required-key credential collision must remain a safe hard failure.\\n- If cleanup also failed, the thrown failure must retain a callable, serialized retry owner without exposing the unsafe report.\\n- Add a combined structural-collision plus failed-cleanup regression that retries cleanup successfully.\\n````\\n\\n</details>\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"PRRT_kwDOP-e7KM6jybjm\",\n      \"path\": \"mcpfn/testing/src/suite.ts\",\n      \"isResolved\": false,\n      \"currentCount\": 1,\n      \"latest\": {\n        \"author\": \"cubic-dev-ai\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2026-09-18T15:07:07Z\",\n        \"outdated\": false,\n        \"line\": 390,\n        \"url\": \"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/170#discussion_r4047959467\",\n        \"body\": \"<!-- cubic:v=cb20f140-b9f3-4dd8-a1f8-e7e83edc5da8 -->\\n<!-- cubic:review-run=47c61d9f-3ebe-5e12-b906-aab16497065f -->\\n<!-- metadata:{\\\"confidence\\\":9} -->\\nP1: When final report redaction collides with a credential after `client.close()` failed, this branch discards the retryable cleanup owner. Preserve the cleanup error and retry handle before surfacing the structural-serialization failure.\\n\\n<details>\\n<summary>Prompt for AI agents</summary>\\n\\n```text\\nCheck if this issue is valid — if so, understand the root cause and fix it. At mcpfn/testing/src/suite.ts, line 390:\\n\\n<comment>When final report redaction collides with a credential after `client.close()` failed, this branch discards the retryable c