easoning"},{"call_id":"call_cR0IVW3h3jidffQGkW0Q3bvN","id":"ctc_05349b17f5ad9d6a016aae3cc2f71887d0801962b884d6be88","input":"const r = await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"node -e 'for (const [k,v] of Object.entries({dtstart:1789724424920,updatedAt:1789740198727,lastRunAt:1789740198727,nextRunAt:1789741800000})) console.log(k,new Date(v).toISOString())'\",\"workdir\":\"/Users/serro/Documents/dev/n/worktrees/superfunctions/PR-170\",\"yield_time_ms\":10000,\"max_output_tokens\":2000}); text(r.output);\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"create_time":1789803711.191019,"turn_id":"01a0b89c-b76f-7790-a974-cf2788b054e3"},"name":"exec","status":"completed","type":"custom_tool_call"},{"call_id":"call_cR0IVW3h3jidffQGkW0Q3bvN","id":"ctco_01a0b89d-61ea-7de3-86eb-fc150f17fc0c","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"create_time":1789803717.098378,"turn_id":"01a0b89c-b76f-7790-a974-cf2788b054e3"},"output":[{"text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.4 seconds\nOutput:\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"dtstart 2026-09-18T09:40:24.920Z\nupdatedAt 2026-09-18T14:03:18.727Z\nlastRunAt 2026-09-18T14:03:18.727Z\nnextRunAt 2026-09-18T14:30:00.000Z\n","type":"input_text"}],"type":"custom_tool_call_output"},{"encrypted_content":"REDACTED","id":"rs_05349b17f5ad9d6a016aae3cc6a13c87d094dca4f25c7d8bde","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a0b89c-b76f-7790-a974-cf2788b054e3"},"summary":[{"text":"**Clarifying automation disabled status and merge conflicts**","type":"summary_text"},{"text":"**Summarizing current PR state with ledger citation**","type":"summary_text"},{"text":"**Explaining schema lookup error and automation disable**","type":"summary_text"}],"type":"reasoning"},{"content":[{"text":"It is disabled because I mistakenly treated a Composio schema-discovery 404 as proof that the pinned Skillplane workflow was unavailable. Your rules required disabling the automation in that situation. Direct execution subsequently retrieved and verified the exact workflow successfully, so the disablement was caused by my incorrect availability check—not convergence, PR closure, or an actual Skillplane drift.\n\nCurrent live state:\n\n- Automation `4442e7f3-60f4-4125-a8e4-c818ac40fc82`: `enabled: false`\n- Schedule: every 30 minutes, but no future runs will execute while disabled\n- Last automation update/run: September 18, 2026 at 19:33 IST\n- PR 170: open\n- Head: `cf76637ada4ba0263e36f30c23a278826c48dd0a`\n- Local, upstream, and PR heads match\n- Checks: 14 successful, 1 neutral, 3 skipped; none pending or failing\n- GitHub merge state: `DIRTY`\n- Review decision: unset\n- Active GitHub account: `thyaravind`\n- Worktree: clean except for the intentionally untracked `.conduct/` ledger\n- Convergence: not declared; the last ledger state has clean streak `0` and retains the deferred Sonar family\n\nI only inspected state here; I did not re-enable or otherwise modify the automation.\n\n\u003coai-mem-citation\u003e\n\u003ccitation_entries\u003e\nMEMORY.md:309-343|note=[prior PR 170 workflow boundaries and live verification requirements]\n\u003c/citation_entries\u003e\n\u003crollout_ids\u003e\n01a0a522-f7e4-7422-a0fb-002c30b622cc\n01a0aa3d-a004-7df3-b812-85a576729d2d\n01a0a496-fa30-7f70-ac42-1e7080963f28\n\u003c/rollout_ids\u003e\n\u003c/oai-mem-citation\u003e","type":"output_text"}],"id":"msg_05349b17f5ad9d6a016aae3cd45de487d0a7d65f796a923068","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["unknown"],"create_time":1789803717.677204,"turn_id":"01a0b89c-b76f-7790-a974-cf2788b054e3"},"phase":"final_answer","role":"assistant","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"\u003cskills_instructions\u003e\n## Skills\nA skill is a set of local instructions to follow that is stored in a `SKILL.md` file. Below is the list of skills that can be used. Each entry includes a name, description, and a short path that can be expanded into an absolute path using the skill roots table.\n### Skill roots\n- `r0` = `/Users/serro/.codex/skills`\n- `r1` = `/Users/serro/.agents/skills`\n- `r2` = `/Users/serro/.codex/skills/.system`\n- `r3` = `/Users/serro/.codex/plugins/cache/openai-bundled`\n- `r4` = `/Users/serro/.codex/plugins/cache/openai-curated-remote/cloudflare/0.1.2/skills`\n- `r5` = `/Users/serro/.codex/plugins/cache/openai-curated-remote/figma/11.0.0/skills`\n- `r6` = `/Users/serro/.codex/plugins/cache/openai-curated-remote/google-drive/0.1.16/skills`\n- `r7` = `/Users/serro/.codex/plugins/cache/openai-curated-remote/notion/0.1.8/skills`\n- `r8` = `/Users/serro/.codex/plugins/cache/openai-curated-remote`\n- `r9` = `/Users/serro/.codex/plugins/cache/openai-curated-remote/product-design/0.1.55/skills`\n- `r10` = `/Users/serro/.codex/plugins/cache/openai-curated-remote/sonarqube/2.5.0/skills`\n- `r11` = `/Users/serro/.codex/plugins/cache/openai-primary-runtime`\n- `r12` = `/Users/serro/.codex/plugins/cache/openai-primary-runtime/spreadsheets/26.909.61513/skills`\n### Available skills\n- imagegen: Generate or edit raster images when the task benefits from AI-created bitmap visuals such as photos, illustrations, textures, sprites, mockups, or transparent-background cutouts. Use when Co (file: r2/imagegen/SKILL.md)\n- openai-docs: Use for Codex models/pricing, scheduled tasks, skills, settings, setup, troubleshooting, customization, automations, and self-knowledge—including 'you,' 'your,' 'this app,' or 'this coding a (file: r2/openai-docs/SKILL.md)\n- plugin-creator: Create and scaffold plugin directories for Codex with a required `.codex-plugin/plugin.json`, optional plugin folders/files, valid manifest defaults, and personal-marketplace entries by defa (file: r2/plugin-creator/SKILL.md)\n- skill-creator: Create or update a Codex skill with appropriately scoped instructions and any needed supporting resources. (file: r2/skill-creator/SKILL.md)\n- skill-installer: Install Codex skills into $CODEX_HOME/skills from a curated list or a GitHub repo path. Use when a user asks to list installable skills, i