ctory and uploads them for 14 days, including on failure.\\n></pre>\\n>\\n><a href='https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/170/files#diff-b803fcb7f17ed9235f1e5cb1fcd2f5d3b2838429d4368ae4c57ce4436577f03f'>.github/workflows/ci.yml</a>\\n\\n</details>\\n\\n<details>\\n<summary>publish-tag.yml<code>Verify published testing and CLI packages</code> <code>+6/-0</code></summary>\\n\\n<br/>\\n\\n>Verify published testing and CLI packages\\n>\\n><pre>\\n>• Installs the exact published testing or CLI version from npm and runs clean-consumer verification.\\n></pre>\\n>\\n><a href='https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/170/files#diff-9c90556008958428444a97a22f411bc5cc23fa217f79b9245b3c1803b54ecfae'>.github/workflows/publish-tag.yml</a>\\n\\n</details>\\n\\n<details>\\n<summary>package.json<code>Release CLI with updated McpFn dependencies</code> <code>+3/-3</code></summary>\\n\\n<br/>\\n\\n>Release CLI with updated McpFn dependencies\\n>\\n><pre>\\n>• Bumps the CLI to 0.0.6 and aligns its authentication and testing package versions.\\n></pre>\\n>\\n><a href='https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/170/files#diff-7ac1a0b0c987774df5f704484d63b26c670664d516367173d476cae78d38da66'>mcpfn/cli/package.json</a>\\n\\n</details>\\n\\n<details>\\n<summary>external-http-server.mjs<code>Add authenticated official-SDK MCP fixture</code> <code>+168/-0</code></summary>\\n\\n<br/>\\n\\n>Add authenticated official-SDK MCP fixture\\n>\\n><pre>\\n>• Implements a bounded Streamable HTTP server using only the official SDK, with constant-time API-key checks and session cleanup.\\n></pre>\\n>\\n><a href='https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/170/files#diff-8dfc1bd7c3847bd245a04cb83d7fca6dc24657fac66cacfb9ae547c8fbece01b'>mcpfn/examples/external-http-server.mjs</a>\\n\\n</details>\\n\\n<details>\\n<summary>external-scenarios.mjs<code>Add external server regression scenarios</code> <code>+21/-0</code></summary>\\n\\n<br/>\\n\\n>Add external server regression scenarios\\n>\\n><