evel failed-open lease cleanup until protocol and retained transport handles finish closing, preserving credentials throughout shutdown and retries.\\n- **Bounded target reports exactly** — Switched `test-target` output to compact JSON and checked the final newline-inclusive serialization against `--max-report-bytes`.\\n- **Redacted before truncation** — Routed authenticated conformance output through exact credential scrubbing before the generic output bound, with a fail-closed omission path when redaction exceeds its budget.\\n- **Enforced encoded header limits** — Applied credential value limits to UTF-8 bytes as well as JavaScript string length and expanded boundary regressions.\\n\\n<!--\\nPullfrog review metadata. These findings were written against bebdc22a;\\nif commits have landed on codex/mcp-1-transport-neutral-conformance-0910 since, treat every specific bug, file, or\\nline callout as POTENTIALLY STALE and re-diff before acting on it.\\n\\n- Mode: IncrementalReview (delta against prior pullfrog review)\\n- Files reviewed: 9\\n- Commits reviewed: 1\\n- Base: dev (dac6abf)\\n- Head: codex/mcp-1-transport-neutral-conformance-0910 (bebdc22a)\\n- Reviewed commits:\\n  - bebdc22a — fix(mcpfn): preserve shutdown credentials and redact before truncation\\n- Prior pullfrog review: 16b86310 (https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/170#pullrequestreview-5191802774)\\n-->\\n\\n<!-- PULLFROG_DIVIDER_DO_NOT_REMOVE_PLZ -->\\n<sup><a href=\\\"https://pullfrog.com\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://pullfrog.com/logos/frog-white-full-18px.png\\\"><img src=\\\"https://pullfrog.com/logos/frog-green-full-18px.png\\\" width=\\\"9px\\\" height=\\\"9px\\\" style=\\\"vertical-align: middle; \\\" alt=\\\"Pullfrog\\\"></picture></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;｜ [Fix it ➔](https://pullfrog.com/trigger/21nCo/super-functions/170?action=fix&review_id=5191946954) ｜ [View workflow run](https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/actions/runs/347772867