lfrog\",\"followers_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D/followers\",\"following_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}\",\"gists_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}\",\"starred_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}\",\"subscriptions_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions\",\"organizations_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D/orgs\",\"repos_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D/repos\",\"events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}\",\"received_events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D/received_events\",\"type\":\"Bot\",\"user_view_type\":\"public\",\"site_admin\":false},\"body\":\"> [!IMPORTANT]\\n> The latest delta fixes bounded report settlement but does not fully close the existing Windows process-tree thread, so the prior review disposition remains unchanged.\\n\\n**Reviewed changes** since the prior Pullfrog review at `2ed3223d`, covering the cleanup-cancellation and Windows termination hardening in `2f98827f`.\\n\\n- **Bounded Windows termination** — Extracted process-tree cleanup into a helper that resolves `taskkill.exe` from `SystemRoot`, bounds unresponsive execution, falls back to killing the wrapper, destroys captured streams, and always settles an overflow report.\\n\\n- **Isolated credential cleanup** — Runs revoke and dispose with a fresh non-aborted signal so cancellation of credential acquisition cannot cancel cleanup or later retries.\\n\\n- **Added focused regressions** — Covers successful, failed, and unresponsive Windows `taskkill` execution plus revoke/dispose behavior after acquisition cancellation.\\n\\n<!--\\nPullfrog review metadata. These findings were written against 2f98827f;\\nif commits have landed on codex/mcp-1-transport-neutral-conformance-0910 since, treat every specific bug, file, or\\nline callout as POTENTIALLY STALE and re-diff before acting on it.\\n\\n- Mode: IncrementalReview (delta against prior pullfrog review)\\n- Files reviewed: 49\\n- Commits reviewed: 22\\n- Base: dev (dac6abf)\\n- Head: codex/mcp-1-transport-neutral-conformance-0910 (2f98827f)\\n- Reviewed commits:\\n  - 2f98827f — fix(mcpfn): isolate cleanup cancellation and bound Windows termination\\n- Prior pullfrog review: 2ed3223d (https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/170#pullrequestreview-5194301321)\\n-->\\n\\n<!-- PULLFROG_DIVIDER_DO_NOT_REMOVE_PLZ -->\\n<sup><a href=\\\"https://pullfrog.com\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://pullfrog.com/logos/frog-white-full-18px.png\\\"><img src=\\\"https://pullfrog.com/logos/frog-green-full-18px.png\\\" width=\\\"9px\\\" height=\\\"9px\\\" style=\\\"vertical-align: middle; \\\" alt=\\\"Pullfrog\\\"></picture></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;｜ [Fix it ➔](https://pullfrog.com/trigger/21nCo/super-functions/170?action=fix&review_id=5194648009) ｜ [View workflow run](https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/actions/runs/34813444803/job/103879152511) ｜ Using `GPT Sol` ｜ [𝕏](https://x.com/pullfrogai)</sup>\",\"state\":\"COMMENTED\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/170#pullrequestreview-5194648009\",\"pull_request_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/21nCo/super-functions/pulls/170\",\"author_association\":\"NONE\",\"_links\":{\"html\":{\"href\":\"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/170#pullrequestreview-5194648009\"},\"pull_request\":{\"href\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/21nCo/super-functions/pulls/170\"}},\"submitted_at\":\"2026-09-14T06:39:58Z\",\"commit_id\":\"2f98827f7d4f641ac5f64f34f41c28cb26e10416\"},{\"id\":5194973599,\"node_id\":\"PRR_kwDOP-e7KM8AAAABNaUBnw\",\"user\":{\"login\":\"pullfrog[bot]\",\"id\":226033991,\"node_id\":\"BOT_kgDODXkBRw\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/1768019?v=4\",\"gravatar_id\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/apps/pullfrog\",\"followers_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D/followers\",\"following_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}\",\"gists_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}\",\"starred_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}\",\"subscriptions_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions\",\"organizations_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D/orgs\",\"repos_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D/repos\",\"events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}\",\"received_events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D/received_events\",\"type\":\"Bot\",\"user_view_type\":\"public\",\"site_admin\":false},\"body\":\"> [!IMPORTANT]\\n> The new cleanup-report path can discard the conformance failure that occurred before cleanup exhausted its retries, so the persisted machine artifact loses the diagnosis it was meant to retain.\\n\\n**Reviewed changes** since the prior Pullfrog review at `2f98827f`, covering the seven-file delta in `1d1d1b93`.\\n\\n- **Retained failed cleanup reports** — Attached a bounded, redacted official-conformance result to `McpFnConformanceCleanupError` and allowed the CLI to persist it.\\n- **Preserved structural versions** — Kept trusted conformance-suite and report-schema versions stable when credential values collide with them.\\n- **Hid Windows cleanup processes** — Added `windowsHide` to the bounded `taskkill.exe` invocation.\\n- **Added focused regressions** — Covered CLI report persistence, cleanup-result redaction, structural version collisions, and explicit retry behavior.\\n\\n<!--\\nPullfrog review metadata. These findings were written against 1d1d1b93;\\nif commits have landed on codex/mcp-1-transport-neutral-conformance-0910 since, treat every specific bug, file, or\\nline callout as POTENTIALLY STALE and re-diff before acting on it.\\n\\n- Mode: IncrementalReview (delta against prior pullfrog review)\\n- Files reviewed: 50\\n- Commits reviewed: 23\\n- Base: dev (dac6abf)\\n- Head: codex/mcp-1-transport-neutral-conformance-0910 (1d1d1b93)\\n- Reviewed commits:\\n  - 1d1d1b93 — fix(mcpfn): retain failed cleanup reports and structural versions\\n- Prior pullfrog review: 2f98827f (https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/170#pullrequestreview-5194648009)\\n-->\\n\\n<!-- PULLFROG_DIVIDER_DO_NOT_REMOVE_PLZ -->\\n<sup><a href=\\\"https://pullfrog.com\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://pullfrog.com/logos/frog-white-full-18px.png\\\"><img src=\\\"https://pullfrog.com/logos/frog-green-full-18px.png\\\" width=\\\"9px\\\" height=\\\"9px\\\" style=\\\"vertical-align: middle; \\\" alt=\\\"Pullfrog\\\"></picture></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;｜ [Fix all ➔](https://pullfrog.com/trigger/21nCo/super-functions/170?action=fix&review_id=5194973599) ｜ [Fix 👍s ➔](https://pullfrog.com/trigger/21nCo/super-functions/170?action=fix-approved&review_id=5194973599) ｜ [View workflow run](https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/actions/runs/34817290979/job/103890584616) ｜ Using `GPT Sol` ｜ [𝕏](https://x.com/pullfrogai)</sup>\",\"state\":\"COMMENTED\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/170#pullrequestreview-5194973599\",\"pull_request_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/21nCo/super-functions/pulls/170\",\"author_association\":\"NONE\",\"_links\":{\"html\":{\"href\":\"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/170#pullrequestreview-5194973599\"},\"pull_request\":{\"href\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/21nCo/super-functions/pulls/170\"}},\"submitted_at\":\"2026-09-14T07:26:04Z\",\"commit_id\":\"1d1d1b93303af6f022cfd6f1dbf2293dc2b1aaa5\"},{\"id\":5194996892,\"node_id\":\"PRR_kwDOP-e7KM8AAAABNaVcnA\",\"user\":{\"login\":\"chatgpt-codex-connector[bot]\",\"id\":199175422