rted throwing custom scrubbers into bounded incomplete reports with secret-free fallback content.\\n- **Expanded suite coverage** — Added metadata, expected-tool failure, and throwing-redactor cases for custom targets.\\n\\n<!--\\nPullfrog review metadata. These findings were written against 793fa12;\\nif commits have landed on codex/mcp-1-transport-neutral-conformance-0910 since, treat every specific bug, file, or\\nline callout as POTENTIALLY STALE and re-diff before acting on it.\\n\\n- Mode: IncrementalReview (delta against prior pullfrog review)\\n- Files reviewed: 55\\n- Commits reviewed: 38\\n- Base: dev (2867c68)\\n- Head: codex/mcp-1-transport-neutral-conformance-0910 (793fa12)\\n- Reviewed commits:\\n  - 793fa123 — fix(mcpfn): apply custom redactors to suite artifacts\\n  - b245fe63 — fix(mcpfn): preserve credential encoding semantics\\n  - 96edf052 — fix(mcpfn): redact encoded credential reflections\\n  - 8d18e518 — fix(mcpfn): await initialization cleanup during close\\n  - 4579aaf1 — fix(mcpfn): retain failed initialization shutdown owners\\n  - 0c8948af — fix(mcpfn): order shutdown and preserve credential contracts\\n  - 422c753d — merge dev and preserve session cleanup ownership\\n  - e664880b — fix(mcpfn): stabilize credential ownership and safe reporting\\n  - a080b785 — fix(mcpfn): fail closed on unsafe error inspection\\n  - 167afb7a — fix(mcpfn): preserve credential cleanup and failure redaction\\n  - 8d45c838 — fix(mcpfn): bound default CLI report serialization\\n  - 1195831f — fix(mcpfn): close authenticated report redaction gaps\\n  - 30f398b6 — fix(mcpfn): preserve provider identity and sanitize failed opens\\n  - 25ed30dc — fix(mcpfn): preserve credential lifecycle and diagnostic contracts\\n  - bd07bfc4 — fix(mcpfn): redact programmatic artifacts and retain conformance evidence\\n  - 1d1d1b93 — fix(mcpfn): retain failed cleanup reports and structural versions\\n  - 2f98827f — fix(mcpfn): isolate cleanup cancellation and bound Windows termination\\n  - 2ed3223d — fix(mcpfn): enforce pending shutdown and terminate runner trees\\n  - 36c4a3a1 — fix(mcpfn): bound conformance capture and order deferred cleanup\\n  - 45affe39 — fix(mcpfn): preserve permanent shutdown and compact report bounds\\n  - 4bb10b48 — fix(mcpfn): classify cleanup errors and reject invalid-client redirects\\n  - bebdc22a — fix(mcpfn): preserve shutdown credentials and redact before truncation\\n  - 16b86310 — fix(mcpfn): bound credentials and clean up before diagnostics\\n  - b9ec3a7d — fix(mcpfn): preserve credential cleanup and conformance report integrity\\n  - 10d5eac2 — fix(mcpfn): retain conformance cleanup and validate OAuth report evidence\\n  - 3ffdf24b — fix(mcpfn): gate reconnect on credential cleanup and redact before truncation\\n  - a93ef9c5 — fix(mcpfn): use explicit inventory ordering and Windows cleanup executable\\n  - 933c96a0 — ci: run JavaScript tests on required Node 22 runtime\\n  - 76a5a16c — Merge branch 'dev' into codex/mcp-1-transport-neutral-conformance-0910\\n  - f78a72ae — fix(mcpfn): retain failed credential cleanup and redact inspect errors\\n  - b6ac854c — fix(mcpfn): align client dependents and regenerate workspace lock\\n  - 5a32dbf9 — fix(mcpfn): serialize retained cleanup and reject authorization JSON errors\\n  - c4b1fe5e — fix(mcpfn): retain cleanup ownership and bound typed report redaction\\n  - dd1ac078 — fix(mcpfn): preserve redacted reports and retry credential cleanup\\n  - 9f42334f — fix(mcpfn): redact authenticated outputs and preserve cleanup ownership\\n  - 1e7d9eb0 — fix(mcpfn): protect credential artifacts and validate rejection envelopes\\n  - a7c0dea4 — fix(mcpfn): prevent false conformance success and preserve lifecycle evidence\\n  - f796d70a — feat(mcpfn): add transport-neutral conformance testing\\n- Prior pullfrog review: b245fe6 (https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/170#pullrequestreview-5201337422)\\n-->\\n\\n<!-- PULLFROG_DIVIDER_DO_NOT_REMOVE_PLZ -->\\n<sup><a hre