eep credential replacements collision safe\\n- Prior pullfrog review: e77a401f (https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/170#pullrequestreview-5206106307)\\n-->\\n\\n<!-- PULLFROG_DIVIDER_DO_NOT_REMOVE_PLZ -->\\n<sup><a href=\\\"https://pullfrog.com\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://pullfrog.com/logos/frog-white-full-18px.png\\\"><img src=\\\"https://pullfrog.com/logos/frog-green-full-18px.png\\\" width=\\\"9px\\\" height=\\\"9px\\\" style=\\\"vertical-align: middle; \\\" alt=\\\"Pullfrog\\\"></picture></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;｜ [Fix all ➔](https://pullfrog.com/trigger/21nCo/super-functions/170?action=fix&review_id=5206406230) ｜ [Fix 👍s ➔](https://pullfrog.com/trigger/21nCo/super-functions/170?action=fix-approved&review_id=5206406230) ｜ [View workflow run](https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/actions/runs/34937179242/job/104277535497) ｜ Using `GPT Sol` ｜ [𝕏](https://x.com/pullfrogai)</sup>\",\"state\":\"COMMENTED\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/170#pullrequestreview-5206406230\",\"pull_request_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/21nCo/super-functions/pulls/170\",\"author_association\":\"NONE\",\"_links\":{\"html\":{\"href\":\"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/170#pullrequestreview-5206406230\"},\"pull_request\":{\"href\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/21nCo/super-functions/pulls/170\"}},\"submitted_at\":\"2026-09-15T06:36:23Z\",\"commit_id\":\"37a072aeb5b3db53513d5381d4b85300100e0534\"},{\"id\":5206652497,\"node_id\":\"PRR_kwDOP-e7KM8AAAABNlc2UQ\",\"user\":{\"login\":\"chatgpt-codex-connector[bot]\",\"id\":199175422,\"node_id\":\"BOT_kgDOC98s_g\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/1144995?v=4\",\"gravatar_id\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/chatgpt-codex-connector%5Bbot%5D\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/apps/chatgpt-codex-connector\",\"followers_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/chatgpt-codex-connector%5Bbot%5D/followers\",\"follow