\\n><a href='https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/170/files#diff-181433c1d1ad6e3346373ee669cd3f46fdeb38a8ddb7bf67d269d9713b6d4feb'>mcpfn/testing/vitest.config.ts</a>\\n\\n</details>\\n\\n<details>\\n<summary>package-lock.json<code>Synchronize McpFn package dependency graph</code> <code>+601/-249</code></summary>\\n\\n<br/>\\n\\n>Synchronize McpFn package dependency graph\\n>\\n><pre>\\n>• Records testing and CLI version bumps, the runtime authentication dependency, and regenerated workspace dependency placement.\\n></pre>\\n>\\n><a href='https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/170/files#diff-053150b640a7ce75eff69d1a22cae7f0f94ad64ce9a855db544dda0929316519'>package-lock.json</a>\\n\\n</details>\\n\\n<details>\\n<summary>gate-mcpfn-release.mjs<code>Gate public exports and external server behavior</code> <code>+8/-0</code></summary>\\n\\n<br/>\\n\\n>Gate public exports and external server behavior\\n>\\n><pre>\\n>• Checks packed-consumer exports and runs the authenticated official-SDK fixture during the release gate.\\n></pre>\\n>\\n><a href='https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/170/files#diff-ac47695e6cdf4da7f9fac66b31c7bbb86f475880d60e7748dba903d741562edd'>scripts/gate-mcpfn-release.mjs</a>\\n\\n</details>\\n\\n<details>\\n<summary>test-mcpfn-registry-install.mjs<code>Verify exact registry releases in clean consumers</code> <code>+158/-0</code></summary>\\n\\n<br/>\\n\\n>Verify exact registry releases in clean consumers\\n>\\n><pre>\\n>• Retries registry installation and exercises published testing or CLI packages against the external authenticated fixture.\\n></pre>\\n>\\n><a href='https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/170/files#diff-09b3986f6b604324d01aeeb45b2057f9704c931a47fe4bd23dceba2518dbad68'>scripts/test-mcpfn-registry-install.mjs</a>\\n\\n</details>\\n\\n</dd>\\n</dl>\\n\\n</details>\\n\\n</dd>\\n</dl>\\n\\n</details>\",\"author_association\":\"NONE\",\"reactions\":{\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/21nCo/super-functions/