</details>\",\"state\":\"COMMENTED\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/170#pullrequestreview-5186123910\",\"pull_request_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/21nCo/super-functions/pulls/170\",\"author_association\":\"NONE\",\"_links\":{\"html\":{\"href\":\"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/170#pullrequestreview-5186123910\"},\"pull_request\":{\"href\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/21nCo/super-functions/pulls/170\"}},\"submitted_at\":\"2026-09-12T10:15:58Z\",\"commit_id\":\"dd1ac0787f2a550be2f23cc1099f6e3680de2ae7\"},{\"id\":5186129278,\"node_id\":\"PRR_kwDOP-e7KM8AAAABNR4Nfg\",\"user\":{\"login\":\"cubic-dev-ai[bot]\",\"id\":191113872,\"node_id\":\"BOT_kgDOC2QqkA\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/1082092?v=4\",\"gravatar_id\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/cubic-dev-ai%5Bbot%5D\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/apps/cubic-dev-ai\",\"followers_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/cubic-dev-ai%5Bbot%5D/followers\",\"following_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/cubic-dev-ai%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}\",\"gists_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/cubic-dev-ai%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}\",\"starred_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/cubic-dev-ai%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}\",\"subscriptions_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/cubic-dev-ai%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions\",\"organizations_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/cubic-dev-ai%5Bbot%5D/orgs\",\"repos_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/cubic-dev-ai%5Bbot%5D/repos\",\"events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/cubic-dev-ai%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}\",\"received_events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/cubic-dev-ai%5Bbot%5D/received_events\",\"type\":\"Bot\",\"user_view_type\":\"public\",\"site_admin\":false},\"body\":\"<!-- cubic:review-summary:start -->\\n**1 issue found** across 11 files (changes from recent commits).\\n<!-- cubic:review-summary:end -->\\n\\n<details>\\n<summary>Prompt for AI agents (unresolved issues)</summary>\\n\\n```text\\n\\nCheck if these issues are valid — if so, understand the root cause of each and fix them. If appropriate, use sub-agents to investigate and fix each issue separately.\\n\\n\\n<file name=\\\"mcpfn/cli/src/index.ts\\\">\\n\\n<violation number=\\\"1\\\" location=\\\"mcpfn/cli/src/index.ts:244\\\">\\nP1: When an MCP event or metadata object uses the credential as a property name, `preserveKeys: true` leaves that key intact and `inspect` writes the credential to stdout and `--output`. Keep key redaction enabled for the snapshot, or extend the helper’s dynamic-payload handling before preserving keys here.</violation>\\n</file>\\n```\\n\\n</details>\\n\\n<sub>**Tip**: Review your code locally with the [cubic CLI](https://docs.cubic.dev/ide/cli-review?utm_source=github&utm_content=general_review_body) to iterate faster.<br /><br />[Re-trigger cubic](https://www.cubic.dev/action/re-review/pr/21nCo/super-functions/170/REDACTED?returnTo=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2F21nCo%2Fsuper-functions%2Fpull%2F170)</sub>\\n\\n<!-- cubic:review-post:REDACTED:dd1ac0787f2a550be2f23cc1099f6e3680de2ae7:d0759292-1d4e-52c6-bb42-eba4cfe4de6e -->\",\"state\":\"COMMENTED\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/170#pullrequestreview-5186129278\",\"pull_request_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/21nCo/super-functions/pulls/170\",\"author_association\":\"NONE\",\"_links\":{\"html\":{\"href\":\"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/170#pullrequestreview-5186129278\"},\"pull_request\":{\"href\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/21nCo/super-functions/pulls/170\"}},\"submitted_at\":\"2026-09-12T10:18:50Z\",\"commit_id\":\"dd1ac0787f2a550be2f23cc1099f6e3680de2ae7\"},{\"id\":5186133170,\"node_id\":\"PRR_kwDOP-e7KM8AAAABNR4csg\",\"user\":{\"login\":\"pullfrog[bot]\",\"id\":226033991,\"node_id\":\"BOT_kgDODXkBRw\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/1768019?v=4\",\"gravatar_id\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/apps/pullfrog\",\"followers_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D/followers\",\"following_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}\",\"gists_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}\",\"starred_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}\",\"subscriptions_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions\",\"organizations_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D/orgs\",\"repos_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D/repos\",\"events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}\",\"received_events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D/received_events\",\"type\":\"Bot\",\"user_view_type\":\"public\",\"site_admin\":false},\"body\":\"\",\"state\":\"COMMENTED\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/170#pullrequestreview-5186133170\",\"pull_request_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/21nCo/super-functions/pulls/170\",\"author_association\":\"NONE\",\"_links\":{\"html\":{\"href\":\"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/170#pullrequestreview-5186133170\"},\"pull_request\":{\"href\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/21nCo/super-functions/pulls/170\"}},\"submitted_at\":\"2026-09-12T10:20:31Z\",\"commit_id\":\"dd1ac0787f2a550be2f23cc1099f6e3680de2ae7\"},{\"id\":5186133254,\"node_id\":\"PRR_kwDOP-e7KM8AAAABNR4dBg\",\"user\":{\"login\":\"pullfrog[bot]\",\"id\":226033991,\"node_id\":\"BOT_kgDODXkBRw\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/1768019?v=4\",\"gravatar_id\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/apps/pullfrog\",\"followers_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D/followers\",\"following_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}\",\"gists_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}\",\"starred_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}\",\"subscriptions_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions\",\"organizations_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D/orgs\",\"repos_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D/repos\",\"events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}\",\"received_events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D/received_events\",\"type\":\"Bot\",\"user_view_type\":\"public\",\"site_admin\":false},\"body\":\"\",\"state\":\"COMMENTED\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/170#pullrequestreview-5186133254\",\"pull_request_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/21nCo/super-functions/pulls/170\",\"author_association\":\"NONE\",\"_links\":{\"html\":{\"href\":\"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/170#pullrequestreview-5186133254\"},\"pull_request\":{\"href\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/21nCo/super-functions/pulls/170\"}},\"submitted_at\":\"2026-09-12T10:20:34Z\",\"commit_id\":\"dd1ac0787f2a550be2f23cc1099f6e3680de2ae7\"},{\"id\":5186137079,\"node_id\":\"PRR_kwDOP-e7KM8AAAABNR4r9w\",\"user\":{\"login\":\"pullfrog[bot]\",\"id\":226033991,\"node_id\":\"BOT_kgDODXkBRw\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/1768019?v=4\",\"gravatar_id\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/apps/pullfrog\",\"followers_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D/followers\",\"following_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}\",\"gists_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}\",\"starred_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}\",\"subscriptions_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions\",\"organizations_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D/orgs\",\"repos_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D/repos\",\"events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}\",\"received_events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D/received_events\",\"type\":\"Bot\",\"user_view_type\":\"public\",\"site_admin\":false},\"body\":\"> [!IMPORTANT]\\n> Exact-value credential scrubbing can corrupt fixed report values, producing contradictory machine-readable results for otherwise successful runs.\\n\\n**Reviewed changes** since the prior Pullfrog review at `9f42334`, covering the hardening added in `dd1ac078`.\\n\\n- **Preserved report shape** — Removed generic collection truncation from credential scrubbing and introduced key-preserving redaction for finalized artifacts.\\n\\n- **Made cleanup retryable** — Reset failed credential lease and authenticated-handle cleanup promises, retained completed lifecycle stages, and blocked reconnect until cleanup succeeds.\\n\\n- **Hardened authenticated conformance** — Rejected raw upstream artifacts before credential acquisition, forced output capture, and preserved redacted report envelopes.\\n\\n- **Tightened OAuth rejection checks** — Validated JSON media types and restricted unsupported-grant responses to HTTP 400 with focused regressions.\\n\\n<!--\\nPullfrog review metadata. These findings were written against dd1ac07;\\nif commits have landed on codex/mcp-1-transport-neutral-conformance-0910 since, treat every specific bug, file, or\\nline callout as POTENTIALLY STALE and re-diff before acting on it.\\n\\n- Mode: IncrementalReview (delta against prior pullfrog review)\\n- Files reviewed: 41\\n- Commits reviewed: 5\\n- Base: dev (138e1ef)\\n- Head: codex/mcp-1-transport-neutral-conformance-0910 (dd1ac07)\\n- Reviewed commits:\\n  - dd1ac07 — fix(mcpfn): preserve redacted reports and retry credential cleanup\\n  - 9f42334 — fix(mcpfn): redact authenticated outputs and preserve cleanup ownership\\n  - 1e7d9eb — fix(mcpfn): protect credential artifacts and validate rejection envelopes\\n  - a7c0dea — fix(mcpfn): prevent false conformance success and preserve lifecycle evidence\\n  - f796d70 — feat(mcpfn): add transport-neutral conformance testing\\n- Prior pullfrog review: 9f42334 (https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/170#pullrequestreview-5185635773)\\n-->\\n\\n<!-- PULLFROG_DIVIDER_DO_NOT_REMOVE_PLZ -->\\n<sup><a href=\\\"https://pullfrog.com\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://pullfrog.com/logos/frog-white-full-18px.png\\\"><img src=\\\"https://pullfrog.com/logos/frog-green-full-18px.png\\\" width=\\\"9px\\\" height=\\\"9px\\\" style=\\\"vertical-align: middle; \\\" alt=\\\"Pullfrog\\\"></picture></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;｜ [Fix all ➔](https://pullfrog.com/trigger/21nCo/super-functions/170?action=fix&review_id=5186137079) ｜ [Fix 👍s ➔](https://pullfrog.com/trigger/21nCo/super-functions/170?action=fix-approved&review_id=5186137079) ｜ [View workflow run](https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/actions/runs/34687840222/job/103537856687) ｜ Using `GPT Sol` ｜ [𝕏](https://x.com/pullfrogai)</sup>\",\"state\":\"COMMENTED\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/170#pullrequestreview-5186137079\",\"pull_request_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/21nCo/super-functions/pulls/170\",\"author_association\":\"NONE\",\"_links\":{\"html\":{\"href\":\"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/170#pullrequestreview-5186137079\"},\"pull_request\":{\"href\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/21nCo/super-functions/pulls/170\"}},\"submitted_at\":\"2026-09-12T10:22:33Z\",\"commit_id\":\"dd1ac0787f2a550be2f23cc1099f6e3680de2ae7\"},{\"id\":5186426767,\"node_id\":\"PRR_kwDOP-e7KM8AAAABNSKXjw\",\"user\":{\"login\":\"cubic-dev-ai[bot]\",\"id\":191113872,\"node_id\":\"BOT_kgDOC2QqkA\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/1082092?v=4\",\"gravatar_id\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/cubic-dev-