g review at `dd1ac078`, covering the cleanup and typed-redaction hardening in `c4b1fe5e`.\\n\\n- **Retained cleanup ownership** — Preserved failed handle cleanup after remote protocol closure and late completion of an aborted target open.\\n- **Bounded typed redaction** — Added role-aware structural value preservation, traversal budgets, and an incomplete target-suite fallback.\\n- **Expanded regressions** — Added remote-close, late-open, fixed-status, redaction-limit, and exact unsupported-grant status coverage.\\n\\n<!--\\nPullfrog review metadata. These findings were written against c4b1fe5;\\nif commits have landed on codex/mcp-1-transport-neutral-conformance-0910 since, treat every specific bug, file, or\\nline callout as POTENTIALLY STALE and re-diff before acting on it.\\n\\n- Mode: IncrementalReview (delta against prior pullfrog review)\\n- Files reviewed: 41\\n- Commits reviewed: 6\\n- Base: dev (138e1ef)\\n- Head: codex/mcp-1-transport-neutral-conformance-0910 (c4b1fe5)\\n- Reviewed commits:\\n  - f796d70a — feat(mcpfn): add transport-neutral conformance testing\\n  - a7c0dea4 — fix(mcpfn): prevent false conformance success and preserve lifecycle evidence\\n  - 1e7d9eb0 — fix(mcpfn): protect credential artifacts and validate rejection envelopes\\n  - 9f42334f — fix(mcpfn): redact authenticated outputs and preserve cleanup ownership\\n  - dd1ac078 — fix(mcpfn): preserve redacted reports and retry credential cleanup\\n  - c4b1fe5e — fix(mcpfn): retain cleanup ownership and bound typed report redaction\\n- Prior pullfrog review: dd1ac078 (https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/170#pullrequestreview-5186137079)\\n-->\\n\\n<!-- PULLFROG_DIVIDER_DO_NOT_REMOVE_PLZ -->\\n<sup><a href=\\\"https://pullfrog.com\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://pullfrog.com/logos/frog-white-full-18px.png\\\"><img src=\\\"https://pullfrog.com/logos/frog-green-full-18px.png\\\" width=\\\"9px\\\" height=\\\"9px\\\" style=\\\"vertic