ed30dc`.\\n\\n- Resolved the three prior redaction and reverse-package-dependency threads.\\n- Confirmed the McpFn release gate and Node 18 CommonJS check pass; local tests remained blocked by the out-of-sync root lockfile and timed-out fallback install.\\n- Kept the existing Node 20 coverage and Windows descendant-cleanup threads open because this commit does not affect them.\\n\\n<!-- PULLFROG_DIVIDER_DO_NOT_REMOVE_PLZ -->\\n<sup><a href=\\\"https://pullfrog.com\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://pullfrog.com/logos/frog-white-full-18px.png\\\"><img src=\\\"https://pullfrog.com/logos/frog-green-full-18px.png\\\" width=\\\"9px\\\" height=\\\"9px\\\" style=\\\"vertical-align: middle; \\\" alt=\\\"Pullfrog\\\"></picture></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;｜ [Fix all ➔](https://pullfrog.com/trigger/21nCo/super-functions/170?action=fix&review_id=5196019923) ｜ [Fix 👍s ➔](https://pullfrog.com/trigger/21nCo/super-functions/170?action=fix-approved&review_id=5196019923) ｜ [View workflow run](https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/actions/runs/34825985348/job/103918155369) ｜ Using `GPT Sol` ｜ [𝕏](https://x.com/pullfrogai)</sup>\",\"state\":\"COMMENTED\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/170#pullrequestreview-5196019923\",\"pull_request_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/21nCo/super-functions/pulls/170\",\"author_association\":\"NONE\",\"_links\":{\"html\":{\"href\":\"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/170#pullrequestreview-5196019923\"},\"pull_request\":{\"href\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/21nCo/super-functions/pulls/170\"}},\"submitted_at\":\"2026-09-14T09:21:52Z\",\"commit_id\":\"25ed30dce78a9d30f52d3f857f0edfb3f4fa9223\"},{\"id\":5196272071,\"node_id\":\"PRR_kwDOP-e7KM8AAAABNbjRxw\",\"user\":{\"login\":\"chatgpt-codex-connector[bot]\",\"id\":199175422,\"node_id\":\"BOT_kgDOC98s_g\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/1144995?v=4\",\"gravatar_id\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://api.githu