ved_events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D/received_events\",\"type\":\"Bot\",\"user_view_type\":\"public\",\"site_admin\":false},\"body\":\"> ✅ No new issues found.\\n\\nReviewed `e664880b..422c753d` and the complete PR diff. The merge-resolution changes preserve typed inspect runtime failures, keep failed target initialization under session-owned exact-once cleanup, and harden the Node 20 install lane by disabling general lifecycle scripts while rebuilding esbuild explicitly.\\n\\n`git diff --check` passed. Remote Node 18 CommonJS, Node 20 compatibility, McpFn release-gate, SonarCloud, analysis, and security checks pass. Local suites could not start because Node 24/npm 11 rejects the known incomplete Turbo platform lock records, and the supported Node 22/npm 10 install retry timed out before test binaries became available.\\n\\n<!-- PULLFROG_DIVIDER_DO_NOT_REMOVE_PLZ -->\\n<sup><a href=\\\"https://pullfrog.com\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://pullfrog.com/logos/frog-white-full-18px.png\\\"><img src=\\\"https://pullfrog.com/logos/frog-green-full-18px.png\\\" width=\\\"9px\\\" height=\\\"9px\\\" style=\\\"vertical-align: middle; \\\" alt=\\\"Pullfrog\\\"></picture></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;｜ [View workflow run](https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/actions/runs/34860282566/job/104030372453) ｜ Using `GPT Sol` ｜ [𝕏](https://x.com/pullfrogai)</sup>\",\"state\":\"COMMENTED\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/170#pullrequestreview-5199585062\",\"pull_request_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/21nCo/super-functions/pulls/170\",\"author_association\":\"NONE\",\"_links\":{\"html\":{\"href\":\"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/170#pullrequestreview-5199585062\"},\"pull_request\":{\"href\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/21nCo/super-functions/pulls/170\"}},\"submitted_at\":\"2026-09-14T15:23:52Z\",\"commit_id\":\"422c753d18ca9e3aebba6407da1b74e8af8f4a11\"},{\"id\":5199832