only covers the own-enumerable `report`/`name`. Assert the message and report separately so the error-leak guard actually checks the raw cleanup failure text.</violation>\\n</file>\\n```\\n\\n</details>\\n\\n<sub>**Tip**: Review your code locally with the [cubic CLI](https://docs.cubic.dev/ide/cli-review?utm_source=github&utm_content=general_review_body) to iterate faster.<br /><br />[Re-trigger cubic](https://www.cubic.dev/action/re-review/pr/21nCo/super-functions/170/ai_pr_review_github_delivery_78c20af6677c3b224d0625a4d7b762e03a36a9b5e3f04385fe033e56cf9b8d2d?returnTo=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2F21nCo%2Fsuper-functions%2Fpull%2F170)</sub>\\n\\n<!-- cubic:review-post:ai_pr_review_github_delivery_78c20af6677c3b224d0625a4d7b762e03a36a9b5e3f04385fe033e56cf9b8d2d:45785a27458b9f42e20e1fc3023489a0a7d3998d:a8ca27b3-ecd1-5754-a86a-a9042c91c442 -->\",\"state\":\"COMMENTED\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/170#pullrequestreview-5246785201\",\"pull_request_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/21nCo/super-functions/pulls/170\",\"author_association\":\"NONE\",\"_links\":{\"html\":{\"href\":\"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/170#pullrequestreview-5246785201\"},\"pull_request\":{\"href\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/21nCo/super-functions/pulls/170\"}},\"submitted_at\":\"2026-09-18T10:25:58Z\",\"commit_id\":\"45785a27458b9f42e20e1fc3023489a0a7d3998d\"},{\"id\":5246848232,\"node_id\":\"PRR_kwDOP-e7KM8AAAABOLyM6A\",\"user\":{\"login\":\"pullfrog[bot]\",\"id\":226033991,\"node_id\":\"BOT_kgDODXkBRw\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/1768019?v=4\",\"gravatar_id\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/apps/pullfrog\",\"followers_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D/followers\",\"following_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}\",\"gists_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/pullfrog%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_i