mits:\\n  - 45785a27 — fix(mcpfn): preserve cleanup and evidence contracts\\n  - 1e45b794 — fix(mcpfn): preserve credential cleanup contracts\\n  - 8b23aaa0 — fix(mcpfn): close remaining redaction and cleanup gaps\\n  - bd2669ef — fix(mcpfn): bound cleanup failure handling\\n  - 451f20bd — fix(mcpfn): harden redaction key invariants\\n  - 0010a6c7 — fix(mcpfn): close review artifact invariants\\n  - 1e27fd69 — fix(mcpfn): close remaining review invariants\\n  - aa08ef72 — fix(mcpfn): validate final redacted payload strings\\n  - 37a072ae — fix(mcpfn): keep credential replacements collision safe\\n  - e77a401f — fix(mcpfn): track diagnostic omission provenance\\n  - a92257f0 — fix(mcpfn): account for omitted diagnostics in reports\\n  - af4ddc99 — fix(mcpfn): preserve failed connection report evidence\\n  - f4f5f0aa — fix(mcpfn): retain credentials through transport shutdown\\n  - 2c3ea3bb — fix(mcpfn): redact scenario fields as payloads\\n  - e0550a2c — fix(mcpfn): redact live payloads before cleanup\\n  - a57043bb — fix(mcpfn): prevent default redaction marker collisions\\n  - a2315f70 — fix(mcpfn): preserve report structure and failure attribution\\n  - 7ed88154 — fix(mcpfn): coordinate session cleanup ownership\\n  - f3667495 — fix(mcpfn): preserve validation and redaction failure contracts\\n  - 9924c807 — fix(mcpfn): classify conformance operational failures\\n  - 96ab203f — fix(mcpfn): bound artifact collection and preserve event redaction\\n  - 00e661ce — fix(mcpfn): project bounded redacted suite reports\\n  - 85fc0747 — fix(mcpfn): transfer failed suite cleanup ownership\\n  - 793fa123 — fix(mcpfn): apply custom redactors to suite artifacts\\n  - b245fe63 — fix(mcpfn): preserve credential encoding semantics\\n  - 96edf052 — fix(mcpfn): redact encoded credential reflections\\n  - 8d18e518 — fix(mcpfn): await initialization cleanup during close\\n  - 4579aaf1 — fix(mcpfn): retain failed initialization shutdown owners\\n  - 0c8948af — fix(mcpfn): order shutdow