tent omitted because safe serialization failed\\\"\\n-          : \\\"Report content omitted because safe serialization failed\\\",\\n+      incompleteReason: reportProjectionFailureReason(error, projectionFailure),\\n*** End Patch\";\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(patch));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a0b91a-027b-7173-bd75-a52040008bc7","create_time":1789812468.908974}}}
