 request.\\n\\n**Reviewed commit:** `80ba026172`\\n    \\n\\n<details> <summary>ℹ️ About Codex in GitHub</summary>\\n<br/>\\n\\n[Your team has set up Codex to review pull requests in this repo](https://chatgpt.com/codex/cloud/settings/general). Reviews are triggered when you\\n- Open a pull request for review\\n- Mark a draft as ready\\n- Comment \\\"@codex review\\\".\\n\\nIf Codex has suggestions, it will comment; otherwise it will react with 👍.\\n\\n\\n\\n\\nCodex can also answer questions or update the PR. Try commenting \\\"@codex address that feedback\\\".\\n            \\n</details>\",\n      \"htmlUrl\": \"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/170#pullrequestreview-5255348648\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 5255354305,\n      \"user\": \"pullfrog[bot]\",\n      \"state\": \"COMMENTED\",\n      \"submittedAt\": \"2026-09-19T10:27:34Z\",\n      \"commitId\": \"80ba026172a774ea95277393becffa35c9892fc1\",\n      \"body\": \"\",\n      \"htmlUrl\": \"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/170#pullrequestreview-5255354305\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 5255359562,\n      \"user\": \"pullfrog[bot]\",\n      \"state\": \"COMMENTED\",\n      \"submittedAt\": \"2026-09-19T10:29:21Z\",\n      \"commitId\": \"80ba026172a774ea95277393becffa35c9892fc1\",\n      \"body\": \"> [!IMPORTANT]\\n> The suite refactor can bypass cleanup after a target session is already live.\\n\\n**Reviewed changes** since the prior Pullfrog review at `cf76637a`, covering the behavioral delta in `80ba0261`.\\n\\n- **Preserved structural-collision cleanup** — Added a reportless cleanup-owner error and CLI handling so unsafe artifacts remain omitted while cleanup stays retryable.\\n- **Refactored suite execution** — Extracted diagnostic collection, connected execution, artifact projection, and client close handling.\\n- **Refactored hosted authorization** — Split authorization, token exchange, refresh, and rejection-envelope validation into phase-specific helpers.\\n- **Hardened artifact boundaries** — Preserved inspector schema keys, tightened cache-directive checks, and extracted bounded credential-redaction helpers.\\n\\n<!--\\nPullfrog review metadata. These findings were written against 80ba0261;\\nif commits have landed on codex/mcp-1-transport-neutral-conformance-0910 since, treat every specific bug, file, or\\nline callout as POTENTIALLY STALE and re-diff before acting on it.\\n\\n- Mode: IncrementalReview (delta against prior pullfrog review)\\n- Files reviewed: 61\\n- Commits reviewed: 70\\n- Base: dev (2867c68f)\\n- Head: codex/mcp-1-transport-neutral-conformance-0910 (80ba0261)\\n- Reviewed commits:\\n  - 80ba0261 — fix(mcpfn): close review and analyzer findings (incremental delta; full PR context reviewed through this commit)\\n- Prior pullfrog review: cf76637a (https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/170#pullrequestreview-5249315211)\\n-->\\n\\n<!-- PULLFROG_DIVIDER_DO_NOT_REMOVE_PLZ -->\\n<sup><a href=\\\"https://pullfrog.com\\\"><picture><source media=\\\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\\\" srcset=\\\"https://pullfrog.com/logos/frog-white-full-18px.png\\\"><img src=\\\"https://pullfrog.com/logos/frog-green-full-18px.png\\\" width=\\\"9px\\\" height=\\\"9px\\\" style=\\\"vertical-align: middle; \\\" alt=\\\"Pullfrog\\\"></picture></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;｜ [Fix all ➔](https://pullfrog.com/trigger/21nCo/super-functions/170?action=fix&review_id=5255359562) ｜ [Fix 👍s ➔](https://pullfrog.com/trigger/21nCo/super-functions/170?action=fix-approved&review_id=5255359562) ｜ [View workflow run](https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/actions/runs/35437126199/job/105881585044) ｜ Using `GPT Sol` ｜ [𝕏](https://x.com/pullfrogai)</sup>\",\n      \"htmlUrl\": \"https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/170#pullrequestreview-5255359562\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"newIssues\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": 5741021520,\n      \"user\": \"sonarqubecloud[bot]\",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-09-19T10:23:43Z\",\n      \"body\": \"## [![Quality Gate Passed](https://s