n   609\t# Task Group: September 15 Superfunctions PR #170 bounded remediation and dirty-dev reconciliation\n   610\tscope: Use for live hosted `pr-refetch-fix` work on McpFn PR #170, or scoped publication/reconciliation from a dirty, stale Superfunctions dev checkout.\n   611\tapplies_to: cwd=/Users/serro/Documents/dev/n/superfunctions-dev and /Users/serro/Documents/dev/n/worktrees/superfunctions/PR-170; reuse_rule=PR threads, heads, hosted checks, and checkout state must be revalidated live; preserve unrelated dirty state.\n   612\t\n   613\t## Task 1: Harden PR #170 redaction/export invariants in a bounded hosted round, success\n   614\t\n   615\t### rollout_summary_files\n   616\t\n   617\t- rollout_summaries/REDACTED.md (cwd=/Users/serro/Documents/dev/n/superfunctions-dev, rollout_path=/Users/serro/.codex/sessions/2026/09/15/rollout-2026-09-15T18-25-27-01a0a522-f7e4-7422-a0fb-002c30b622cc.jsonl, updated_at=2026-09-16T12:17:41+00:00, thread_id=01a0a522-f7e4-7422-a0fb-002c30b622cc, Node 22 release gate passed; PR remained DIRTY)\n  1807\t- require Chrome `Ar@fyweb`, archive/tmp separation, checkpoints, truthful access/error state, and tab cleanup; do not substitute browsers or fabricate content. [Task 1]\n  1808\t- incomplete/stale source families remain explicit zero coverage; Daily Contem needs original links, provenance/freshness caveats, self-contained HTML, and an absolute artifact path. [Task 2]\n  1809\t\n  1810\t## Reusable knowledge\n  1811\t\n  1812\t- Rolling raw/per-post writes recover X browser resets; preserve `contentAccess`/incomplete markers and do not fabricate content. [Task 1]\n  1813\t- Daily reports use only completed in-window archives, validate archive/canonical links and dated/rolling byte parity, and check 1440px plus 500px rendering. [Task 2]\n  1814\t\n  1815\t## Failures and how to do differently\n  1816\t\n  1817\t- `guest activation failed: 404` -> retain incomplete X content and revalidate endpoint/query configuration. [Task 1]\n  