42e7f3-60f4-4125-a8e4-c818ac40fc82` with `orca automations edit 4442e7f3-60f4-4125-a8e4-c818ac40fc82 --disabled --json`, verify with `orca automations show 4442e7f3-60f4-4125-a8e4-c818ac40fc82 --json`, report convergence, and stop.\n4. If PR 170 is merged or closed, record the terminal state, disable and verify this automation, report that the schedule stopped, and stop without mutation.\n5. If a reset-trigger assessment cannot establish a complete coordinated repair, or an external dependency blocks further progress, record the blocker, disable and verify this automation so it cannot repeat unsafe mutations, report the blocker, and stop.\n\nEnd every nonterminal run with the hosted workflow's explicit result buckets and: `One review round is complete. No post-push refetch or additional review loop was performed.`","type":"input_text"}],"id":"msg_01a0b47f-2b24-7032-88bf-970d52144dfe","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["user.text"],"create_time":1789734628.132522,"turn_id":"01a0b47f-239a-79b2-b548-a3c47955992f"},"role":"user","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"Use `$use-skillplane` to retrieve and execute the exact hosted workflow `21n/pr-refetch-fix@1.2.0`, revision 4, digest `sha256:8781c1c12fe9d5902337d6cf21bfbac49dd3a94c7eadd46bf2622db350444022`, for https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/170.\n\nThis is one run of a recurring convergence workflow. Obey the hosted skill's absolute single-round boundary: fetch the complete review surfaces once, assess the exact PR head, make at most one complete fix batch, create at most one commit, push at most once, verify local/remote/PR heads once, report, and stop. Never refetch reviews after pushing, poll CI, wait for reviewers, merge the PR, resolve threads, dismiss reviews, or begin another round in this run.\n\nExecution requirements:\n\n- Work only in `/Users/serro/Documents/dev/n/worktrees/superfunctions/PR-170` on branch `codex/mcp-1-transport-neutral-conformance-0910` for PR